  "sourceTitle": "Cucumber  and Tomato Raita",
  "sourceText": "Cucumber  and Tomato Raita\nBy: jue\nPublished: Wednesday, April 28, 2010 - 9:10am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 Japanese cucumber – washed and grated with the skin\n2 tomato - diced\nChopped fine\n\n1 pip garlic\n1 small onion\n1 green chili seeded\n1 red chili seeded\nDash of pepper and salt\n\n1 cup of yogurt\n1 tablespoon lemon juice or lime\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all the ingredients above and chill it for about 15 min before serving\n\nAbout\n\n\nbest served with warm rice and curry.",
